<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰπειλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold out as a threat to</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆγ᾽ ἔριδος, τὴν πρῶτον ἐπηπείλησ᾽
					Ἀχιλῆϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.319
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπειλάων τὰς -ησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.127
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δείν᾽ ἐ. ἔπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					312
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat.
			only, <i>threaten,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαπειλήσας Ἑλένῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.582
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. fut.
			inf., <i>threaten</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				779
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				630
			</span></i>: but the inf. is freq. omitted, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς ποτ᾽ ἐπηπείλησεν</span> as he
				<i>threatened,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.45
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				752
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰ μὴ . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.2.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς σοῦ τὰ δείν᾽ . . ἐπηπειλημένοι</span>”
				<i>threatened,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					408
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
